Description: Wraps and formats outputs from established statistical and
    psychometric functions into compact tables and summaries designed for
    straightforward export to CSV, Word, and Excel formats. Core utilities
    support psychometric scale preparation, reliability assessment,
    factorability checks, structural equation and mediation analyses,
    inferential tests, and demographic summaries. The package does not
    introduce new statistical methods or estimation procedures; instead, it
    serves as a reporting wrapper around packages such as 'psych', 'stats',
    'lavaan', and 'gtsummary' to facilitate everyday data export workflows in
    clinical and psychological research. It is intended to lower the barrier to
    entry for researchers transitioning into the R ecosystem, with function
    names structured to be intuitive and self-descriptive.
